 <title>794: So Close and Yet So Far</title>
 <link>https://www.thisamericanlife.org/794/so-close-and-yet-so-far</link>
 <description>&lt;p&gt;People ​so close to each other, ​in ​extremely intimate situations​,​ who are also a million miles apart.
